    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c52d671616c0849be803b2d"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Barista, you are not the DropShip I was expecting to extract me from this world and I don't trust you yet.\n\nAre you mercs any good or did you just got joined all together for what you assumed was an easy money fighting the Lone Wolves?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Who are you?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c80ea384f858d6a6b25d688"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9cc297111b2f1dc907975c"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I am Jarring, just Jarring thank you, and I came from Vanra in the Duchy of Orloff, and Magliss Spirits hired me to scout for potential investment locations on several worlds.\n\nOnce your barista left me in my detention cell, I decided to leave, so I stole a pressure suit and hacked an airlock after breaking out.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce637561d7161c229481430"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c83990cfc2c2a0729b67fcf"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "What? Of course we are good, COMPANY has been operating as legitimate registered mercenaries for years with an MRB rating.\n\nAnd how do you know those 'Mechs belonged to the Lone Wolves?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c3f9fd750c30bb4de1cd2a2"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cca93b483dcc8eef05c4849"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Barista, you can be whomever you want, as long as you are able to take me off this planet before the Taurian Constabulary locates me.\n\nIf I tell you about the Lone Wolves, do we have a deal to take me to the next system?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Since you mentioned, why are the Taurians after you?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c3f08b276ee75e37c634f84"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c2e4d78331342775201430f"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Because I figured out what's behind the recent unusual activity on this planet, it must be the same as other sightings that first appeared in the Capellan March a couple of years ago.\n\nAnd in the process I stepped into witnessing how TMM and the Inheritors have been fighting from control of Mirfak.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c552859b7bfd1c6b55fc125"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c53b3bef08e456391a8f018"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The reported unusual x-ray signatures? \n\nThat's more easily explained by one nearby star going supernova, there's nothing strange with them.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c1abf4e7db861579fafd377"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5f4436518388b0d1cbf152"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I disagree... a JumpShip crew first reported these 'sigils' after arriving at Euschelus zenith point, and then other signatures have been reported from Cadiz and Micros III, plus I have confirmation from a third party of sightings in Davion space, and all since two years ago.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c8d114588ff19cd9d201f6d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c64c4a2003049d5427b15eb"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Commander, this is now sounding like some sort of Taurian black operations that they must be running on Mirfak.\n\nThere is a lot more than we are being informed here by our employer, but I don't really trust this 'journalist'.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce3680e2d9b1b80d0cd9caa"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c54c0bddfa3b62de660dd17"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "What the Taurians are doing is to systematically clean up competing claims on Mirfak through mercenary contracts through proxy companies like Tauris Majoris Mining to capture and remove illegal or hostile settlements.\n\nEthnic cleansing looks bad on the news, especially when TMM is doing it against the Far Lookers.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cfbe41a1b0f0b5768cf808c"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c3eb189f10fd7ebaab5d37d"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "You are saying we have been ordered to clear a Far Looker colony by the Concordat representative, acting through TMM?\n\nWhy on Terra would they want it removed?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c0908c369a815ff0beccfa7"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c475d0bc671db7aca1ce6b8"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Because my sources in the Concordat government tell me that there's institutional conflict between several ministries and the Far Lookers supporters who have populated all levels of Taurian society.\n\nColonization is a rich business and full of graft and corruption.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c272f4b7821cbf100783bdc"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c161aaa9173d937898f3071"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Marisol-Chaplin wants to use you as scapegoats, to blame the action to remove the Far Looker colony to rogue mercenaries operating under a Tauris Majoris Mining contract.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
